      {
        "id": "book018-b001443-p000-61cc460bc4",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "大凡奇形怪穴，只怕龙神不对。认得龙真，穴就真，这个口诀价值千金。",
